NavelIsland_Text_1:
	.string "Pfew... I swam here all the way\n"
	.string "from MORO ISLAND.\p"
	.string "Luckily there were some snacks on\n"
	.string "the GRAPEFRUIT ISLANDS.\p"
	.string "Don’t tell the owner I took a few\n"
	.string "grapefruits with me though.\p"
	.string "She can be very strict about\n"
	.string "picking a grapefruit from one of\l"
	.string "her islands.$"

NavelIsland_Text_2:
	.string "I want to leave my footprints in\n"
	.string "the sand everywhere, but they\l"
	.string "disappear quickly…$"

NavelIsland_Text_3:
	.string "This small village on NAVEL ISLAND\n"
	.string "has a nice climate and beaches.\p"
	.string "The mountain up north, however, is\n"
	.string "the roughest and coldest area of\l"
	.string "the ORANGE ARCHIPELAGO.$"

NavelIsland_Text_4:
	.string "NAVEL ISLAND \n"
	.string "The Steep Snowy Island$"
